1
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:54,000
Hi.

2
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:56,125
And you are…

3
00:02:57,813 --> 00:02:59,500
You are Franck.

4
00:03:00,500 --> 00:03:04,000
You are so much more than just a sheep,
aren't you?

5
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:08,000
Oh yeah? How would you know?

6
00:03:10,346 --> 00:03:12,750
Look at you. You're an adventurer, Franck.

7
00:03:13,958 --> 00:03:16,750
Just like me, you're... a lone wolf.

8
00:03:18,625 --> 00:03:21,750
Tell me, does one choose to be alone?

9
00:03:22,917 --> 00:03:25,080
No, one doesn't.
